WEBVTT

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:19.100
Iden: In preparation for Operation: Cinder, we’ve been ordered to the Fondor Shipyards. Agent Hask, you and I will retrieve experimental satellites for the Star Destroyer **Dauntless**, and oversee security for Moff Raythe. Agent Meeko, you have the **Corvus**.

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:38.460
Hask: Commander. We’ve secured the satellites.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:39.360
Iden: Good work, Agent.

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:42.800
Hask: Moff Raythe has informed the Admiral that Operation: Cinder can proceed as planned.

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:46.260
Imperial: Attention, attention. Rebel ships have entered Fondor space.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:01.320
Imperial: All units report to your battlestations immediately.
